{"id":"disposicio_n","lemma":"disposición","pos":"noun","rank":3040,"glosses":["disposal","tendency","fitness"],"ipa":"/disposiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"disposiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-disposici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo mucho dinero a mi disposición.","en":"I have a lot of money at my disposal.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Estoy a su disposición.","en":"I'm at your service.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65266","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Me pongo a su disposición en caso de que necesite algo.","en":"I'm available in case you need something.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692856","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"orangutan"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"something, anything"}],"phrases":[[5,8,"in the event of"]]},{"text":"La buena disposición a tomar responsabilidad es una señal de madurez.","en":"Willingness to take responsibility is a sign of maturity.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"responsibility"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sign"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"maturity"}]}]}